{"c":[{"name":"20261022T012046Z-e14849db8f091ac7","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 vss filters a WHERE inside the HNSW scan (EXPLAIN: Filters: optional); it found 1 in-scope row behind 2,048 nearer rows but none behind 4,096 identical ones (4/4 builds). 1.5.4 post-filters, misses from 32. Scoped semantic stays exact; test uses 4,096.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T012048Z-c88b51be7a8d7001","text":"pragma_hnsw_index_info approx_memory_usage is in-memory size, not disk: 21.0 MB (1.5.4) and 16.8 MB (2.0.0) for a 1,500-row index in a 9.2 MB file. Do not add it to a live-size or reclaimable estimate as disk bytes (measured 2026-10-21).","type":"note"}]}
